# AI

Focus on learning RAG and MCP.

## RAG
Document → Chunk → Embed → Store → Retrieve → LLM

Support both:
- document-based Q&A
- normal LLM Q&A when no document exists

Keep RAG components simple and independently testable.


## MCP
LLM → MCP Client → MCP Server → Tool → Google API

Use explicit tool schemas and validation.

Do not introduce AI agents or unnecessary AI architecture.